This is mostly a dump of some code, it's not polished or anything.

I can sort of render the raw map with OpenGL but sorting is still a problem.
Files are not included. Only PC files supported right now.

The viewer reads the game's data straight out of cement.rcf, so nothing has to be
unpacked: make -f Makefile.gl && make -C p3dview, then

	cd p3dview && ./p3dview -rcf /path/to/Scarface/cement.rcf

See p3dview/README.md for the controls and the environment variables, and
renderer/README.md for what draws the frame.

The fake pddi backend is no longer functional. I only used it early in development.
